<pubDate>Mon, 28 Sep 2026 15:41:27 +0000</pubDate>
<description><![CDATA[<div>大家可以尝试把 monk 的调用链接切换到 <a href="https://api.monk.party/v1" target="_blank" rel="noopener">https://api.monk.party/v1</a> 试试，长连接会稳很多，少一次 Cloudflare 的 TLS 和转发。<br/><br/>适合换成 <a href="https://api.monk.party/v1" target="_blank" rel="noopener">https://api.monk.party/v1</a> 的是会流式输出、会跑很久的客户端，例如 Codex 的 Responses。短请求留在 <a href="https://monk.party/v1" target="_blank" rel="noopener">https://monk.party/v1</a> 也能用。<br/><br/>另外，今晚优化了一下前端设计，后端反馈的几个 bug 也解决了。<br/><br/><a href="http://monk.party/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">monk.party</a> 服务也越来越稳定了，最近那个 space-bunny-alpha 和 gemini 3.8 flash 的组合真是又稳又快又便宜。<i class="emoji" style="background-image:url('//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F8F84.png')"><b>🏄</b></i><br/><br/>看了下后台数据，最近 30 天，Monk 服务输入 Token 总计约 1211.27 亿，缓存 Token约 851.93 亿。</div><p><img src="https://telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F9988.png" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09FA4A3.png" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/a2tq7nVT_sE2tNUJmUXdRNYT_Urf6ZH6r039Sn8u4PinVGDVgWJF3tez2IUjd4YXEViFPyBAKydrl4nTER3bQeB7TDC9GaeoJl17U6dy4Lr8c-DjHoQbY1YNNSoSnEXRyyPydJGf-emqjhHVWnZtnKPAkH40xJd3tMZHXNBRSokC09oH2DZ_F6mX0EJEMAwKfozPbBfTHoRleaCSHtU9_tUmwuQrXNRLt1mMus-5ICdy8zV4UsNm-8Fdq5jcWFC1IUtQ88cECG3GNU52eUCyVyhj-EsK6fAKDGnO9qUVEhR-DVKFDGeFKo2YayNPNwA3r_ZyRxrJeMtBjwALdIyU5w.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F8F84.png" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F918D.png" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F9881.png" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"